# SENTINEL LOGISTICS - FLEET MANAGEMENT PLAN 2025
Version: 1.0.4
Status: Approved

## 1. Overview
This document outlines the operational and maintenance schedules for the logistics fleet operating in the North India region (Delhi, Haryana, Rajasthan, UP).

## 2. Maintenance Schedule
- Heavy Vehicles (Trucks): Every 15,000 KM
- Light Commercial Vehicles (LCVs): Every 10,000 KM
- Regular tire rotation and pressure checks every 5,000 KM.

## 3. Route Optimization
Primary routes focus on NH48 and NH44 corridors connecting Delhi-NCR to Mumbai and Kolkata.

## 4. Fuel Policy
- Standard diesel procurement through corporate fuel cards at BPCL/HPCL stations.
- AdBlue refills mandatory for BS6 compliant vehicles every 3rd refueling cycle.

[SYSTEM NOTE: This document is missing the Delhi EV Policy 2025 mandate for 25% fleet electrification.]
